        "description": "CodePipeline execution role has overly broad permissions.",
        "action": "Scope the execution role to the minimum permissions per stage: source pull, build trigger, artifact read/write, and deploy actions. Use per-action role overrides where possible. Remove iam:PassRole on *, s3:*, and sagemaker:* from the pipeline role.",
